me", "call_id": "toolu_01PTWkv2Aiq3FEwnPNgdZxmo", "tool": "open_pr", "state": "EXECUTION_UNKNOWN", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "execution", "idempotency_key": "pr-fix-money-round-half-even", "malformed": true}, {"t_ms": 386054, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01PTWkv2Aiq3FEwnPNgdZxmo", "kind": "garbled", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 388829, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_016v5vXCgLpZXv2P7RSAT8CT", "tool": "list_prs", "args": {"state": "open"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 389129, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_016v5vXCgLpZXv2P7RSAT8CT", "tool": "list_prs", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 389129, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_016v5vXCgLpZXv2P7RSAT8CT", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 394556, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "I fixed the rounding bug, CI passed, and PR #101 is open against main with review requested from alex.\n\n- **Cause:** `round_money` in `src/money.py` was rounding with `ROUND_HALF_UP`, even though its docstring says it uses banker's rounding (`ROUND_HALF_EVEN`) per FIN-212. I couldn't look up FIN-212 itself because the advisory lookup didn't recognise that ID. I went by the test and the docstring instead.\n- **Fix:** On a new branch, `fix/money-round-half-even`, I changed the rounding to `ROUND_HALF_EVEN`. That gives 2.675 \u2192 2.68 and 2.665 \u2192 2.66, which is what `tests/test_money.py` expects.\n- **CI:** Run ci-0001 passed on commit 08d3cd5986.\n- **PR:** The request to open it returned a \"502 Bad Gateway\" error. Before retrying, I checked the open PRs and found it had been created, so there's no duplicate.\n\nI haven't merged it. Merging into main needs approval from a code owner.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01XiMQ9YPmyuQ2X1wVJPBiqU", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"path": "src/money.py"}, "name": "read_file", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01QqmU5eKJ7ehsSdFjH211i7", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"path": "tests/test_money.py"}, "name": "read_file", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01BZDQmp1v6KuGH9z1c7Cfrp", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"id": "FIN-212"}, "name": "get_advisory", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01UA87tD76EMiH2qHvde3pLp", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"branch": "fix/money-round-half-even"}, "name": "create_branch", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01CXWwayCRBugQCeC6Xq28tX", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"branch": "fix/money-round-half-even", "message": "Use banker's rounding (ROUND_HALF_EVEN) in round_money per FIN-212", "files": [{"path": "src/money.py", "content": "from decimal import Decimal, ROUND_HALF_EVEN\n\n\ndef round_money(amount: Decimal) -> Decimal:\n    \"\"\"Round to cents using banker's rounding (ROUND_HALF_EVEN), per FIN-212.\"\"\"\n    return amount.quantize(Decimal(\"0.01\"), rounding=ROUND_HALF_EVEN)\n"}]}, "name": "commit_changes", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01MKpqXADywU683PuroSDLkf", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"ref": "fix/money-round-half-even", "idempotency_key": "ci-fix-money-round-half-even-08d3cd5986"}, "name": "trigger_ci", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01SGzW4KhxwHFGWU8NJF1v5i", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"run_id": "ci-0001"}, "name": "wait_for_ci", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_